- * that turns the tunnel on. Refused, with why in DVBRIDGE_REFUSED and in the kernel log: the display
- * keeps its last configuration and user space goes on without the tunnel (HDR10).
+ * each tunnelled stream of the commit (amdgpu_dm_dvbridge_dcn42_pipe_why()). Refused, with why in
